17:Te2a,[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","name":"Soil remediation services in Etobicoke","serviceType":"soil remediation services","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Canada Spill Cleanup & Remediation","telephone":"+1888XXXXXXX","url":"https://spillresponsecrew.com/"},"areaServed":"Etobicoke","url":"https://spillresponsecrew.com/soil-remediation-services-etobicoke","description":"We coordinate sampling, excavation, and off-site disposal with your environmental consultant. This soil remediation services visit in Etobicoke often means securing a corner unit before morning foot traffic. Dispatch for Etobicoke—about Toronto district—often stages trucks along Islington Village and Queensway plazas before rolling to sites by The Kingsway village. Etobicoke weather patterns matter—Lake breezes corrode exterior door hardware faster near the water. If the break is on a drain with manifest paperwork spec, mention it—we bring torque sticks when needed. Call 1-888-XXX-XXXX with the address, photos of the break, and whether the spill zone is exposed to weather."},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://spillresponsecrew.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Cities","item":"https://spillresponsecrew.com/locations"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Soil remediation services Etobicoke","item":"https://spillresponsecrew.com/soil-remediation-services-etobicoke"}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What affects the price of soil remediation services in Etobicoke?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Price depends on spill type, size, access, and whether on-site is needed tonight. Call 1-888-XXX-XXXX with photos for a range before we book."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you prioritize soil remediation services if the spill zone is exposed in Etobicoke?","acceptedAnswer":{"@t